    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Adapter: Escalation Page  (demo sink)\n\nFires only for `severity = urgent`. Stamps an SLA deadline before writing, so the deadline is set by the automation rather than by whenever a human notices.\n\n| Replace this node | With |\n| --- | --- |\n| `Raise page` | PagerDuty > Create Incident |\n| `Raise page` | Slack > Send Message to #support-urgent |\n| `Raise page` | Opsgenie > Create Alert |\n\n`Stamp SLA deadline` stays in place either way - it is business logic, not transport.",
